lmeida","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/AMS2","ResponseDate":"2023-02-09T17:58:28.7433333"},{"Id":"BET0","Name":"Bruce E. Tarr","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/BET0","ResponseDate":"2023-04-03T14:36:58.2133333"},{"Id":"SLG1","Name":"Susannah M. Whipps","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/SLG1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-25T18:56:28.35"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H3525/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Representative Muratore of Plymouth, a petition (accompanied by bill, House, No. 3525) of Mathew J. Muratore and others relative to parking at certain airports for disabled veterans.  Veterans and Federal Affairs.","DocumentText":"\tSection 5 of chapter 465 of the acts of 1956 is hereby amended by adding the following paragraph:-\r\n\tNo fee shall be exacted and no penalty shall be imposed by the Authority for the parking of any vehicle owned and driven by a disabled veteran bearing the distinctive number plates authorized by section 2 of chapter 90 at an airport property.  \r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Accompanied","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J31","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J31"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}